                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At a time when President Trump\u2019s across-the-board tariffs and rising costs are already hurting Americans, we should not be cutting nutrition assistance.\n\u00a0\nI joined @SenPeterWelch, @SenatorLujan, @RonWyden, @SenJeffMerkley and @GovTinaKotek to stand up for SNAP.",
