                "text": "Happy Thanksgiving! Today, we remember that 450,000 Minnesotans need food assistance \u2014 including almost 150,000 kids and 11,000 veterans. In a time of economic turmoil, food banks and nutrition programs are a lifeline, and we must ensure they are able to support those in need. https://t.co/3aFyfP24sk",
